final class BillingReportBuilder
{
    public function build(?DateTimeImmutable $from, ?DateTimeImmutable $to): BillingReport
    {
        $events = $repo->findRatedInPeriod($from, $to);
        $groups = [];
        foreach ($events as $e) {
            $key = $e->user()."\x1f".$e->model()->qualifiedName();
            $g = $groups[$key] ??= ['user'=>..., 'model'=>..., 'tokens'=>[0,0,0,0], 'cost'=>Money::zero()];
            tokens: += each
            cost: $g['cost']->add($e->money())
        }
        ksort($groups)? — we need to sort by user, then model: sort by the key with the \x1f separator — since \x1f is smaller than any printable char, lexicographic order of "user\x1fmodel" == (user, model) order. Byte-wise — OK.
        Build rows + totals (int, Money totals).
        return BillingReport (row list + total + header?)
    }
}
```

BillingReport DTO: rows are an array of ReportRow(user, model, tokens[4], cost Money), total similarly.

